Z||000001||Taijiguy||08-01-2000||01:54 PM||||This topic has been covered like, a Godzillion times, and there's more information available on this site than you could ever imagine. Use the SEARCH function to locate info on engines, (try different search items, such as 2.8, 3.1, 3.2, 3.4, etc) and you'll find a wealth of knowledge on doing stroke kits, engine swaps, power gains, gains with different mods. The search will give you the most information<P>-Taiji||||reg||1
