Z||000027||RaeQwan||01-24-2001||01:20 AM||||Let me touch upon this discussion bout motors and engines..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> seeing as how I just had this one with 3-4 differant family members..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> proved em all wrong..<P> <A HREF="http://www.dictionary.com/cgi-bin/dict.pl?term=motor" TARGET=_blank>http://www.dictionary.com/cgi-bin/dict.pl?term=motor</A> <BR>Thier second one is of interest to this conversation..<P><B>Motor &lt;noun&gt; A device that converts any form of energy into mechanical energy, especially an internal-combustion engine or an arrangement of coils and magnets that converts electric current into mechanical power.</B><P> <A HREF="http://www.dictionary.com/cgi-bin/dict.pl?term=engine" TARGET=_blank>http://www.dictionary.com/cgi-bin/dict.pl?term=engine</A> <P>#1 is of interest to this conversation as well  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR><B>Engine &lt;noun&gt; A machine that converts energy into mechanical force or motion</B><P>Perhaps this will clear ya'lls minds bout things.. just my 1.50's worth<P>------------------<BR>Ray - AIM: WookieeNC<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ray19nc/" TARGET=_blank>1988 Fiero Coupe</A> - <A HREF="http://www.CarolinaFieros.com" TARGET=_blank>Carolina Fieros</A> - <A HREF="http://www.webjolt.net" TARGET=_blank>WebJolt Network</A>||||reg||1
